{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And when a stranger sojourns among you and makes the Passover.</b> One might think every convert must make a Passover immediately — therefore Scripture says, ״one statute״ etc. Rather, this is its meaning: ״And when a stranger sojourns among you״ — and comes to make the Passover with his fellows, ״according to the statute of the Passover and its ordinance he shall make it״. (Sifrei)"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:03.786611761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}